  "sn21.3:4.3": "Compare the famous episode at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn51.10/en/sujato#3.2'>SN 51.10:3.2</a>. ",
  "sn21.3:5.1": "<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Ghaṭā</i> means either “pot” or “mass”. As a measure it is estimated variously at around 10 kg, 20 kg, or 200 kg. Given the context, I think it was a mound of salt such as would be seen at a salt mine. ",
